  "result": "Perfect! All 617 tests pass. The security issue is fixed.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe vulnerability was in the `acceptInvitation` function in `src/server/services/invitation-service.ts`. When someone tried to accept an invitation token, the code checked:\n- If the invitation was already accepted\n- If the invitation had expired\n\nBut it **did not check if the invitation had been revoked**. \n\nThe fix adds a check for `invitation.revokedAt !== null` before allowing acceptance, preventing users from creating memberships with cancelled invitations. This matches the existing test case that was expecting this behavior, and all tests now pass.",
